{"id":"diagram-revision-d5ac6fc8-d010-418e-b5c2-30a018aa491c","diagramId":"diagram-4ecd0329-a868-4008-b382-6714ab918e22","diagram":{"id":"alt-slot-7","revision":0,"diagramId":"diagram-4ecd0329-a868-4008-b382-6714ab918e22","revisionId":"diagram-revision-d5ac6fc8-d010-418e-b5c2-30a018aa491c","content":{"revisionId":"alt-slot-7:0","ascii":"[E] CanvasHistoryService / coordinated revisions\n===========================================================================\nMappingDocumentController\n  context: CanvasEditingContext {contextId} -- runtime handle only\n       |\n       v\nDefaultCanvasHistoryService\n  WeakMap<CanvasEditingContext, CanvasHistory>\n  object handles isolate viewers of the same persisted context\n       |\n       +-> openContext(document, view, history?) -> frozen handle\n       +-> state -> checkpointId, document, view, canUndo, canRedo\n       +-> document -> resolved document\n       +-> resolve(context, diagramId) -> DiagramView\n       +-> append(document, view, correspondence?) -> history.append\n       +-> navigate(redo?) / reset\n       |     linked transfer -> reject local navigate\n       |     \"Use workspace undo/redo for a canvas transfer.\"\n       +-> exportContext / forkContext / adopt\n       +-> persistenceChanges(since?) / retireTransactions(ids)\n       +-> prepareTransfer / transferBoundary / prepareTransferNavigation\nLOCAL COMMIT\n  controller append -> new checkpoint ID -> CanvasSession.onCommit\n       |\n       v\n  CanvasWorkspace.onPersist(ids) -> WorkspacePersistence.sync(ids)\n       |\n       +-> per-session cursor -> controller.persistenceChanges(cursor)\n       +-> historyChanges(id, delta) -> revision/ + checkpoint/ records\n       |   new session: remove obsolete graph records in same batch\n       +-> metadata + baseline + canvas + viewport + workspace index\n       |   viewState.captureDisplay / captureCamera at persistence boundary\n       v\n  RecordStorage.batch(changes)\n    synchronous cache + pending changes coalesced by key\n    -> scheduled pump -> {requestId, expectedRevision, changes}\n    -> WorkspaceStorage worker -> /api/mapping/workspace/records\n    -> acknowledged revision; flush waits for captured sequence\n\nCOORDINATED COPY / MOVE\n  MappingPage.beginTransfer -> source canvasRevisionId + selected IDs\n       |\n       v\n  busy guard + source checkpoint check + capture workspace\n  runWorkspaceTask('transfer', source/destination histories, input)\n       |\n       v\n  prepared source + destination states + transaction\n  assemble workspace.documents + workspace.transfers\n       |\n       v\n  publishTransfer -> WorkspaceStorage.save(workspace)\n    flush -> worker project(snapshot) -> RecordStorage.commit(changes)\n    definitive REJECTED -> restore prior cache; operation throws\n    ambiguous response -> retry identical request/ID\n       |\n       v\n  acknowledgement -> installWorkspace -> sessions + active destination\n  undo/redo: boundary -> prepareTransferNavigation for both contexts\n    newer overlapping transfers block undo; both canvases required\n    update both states + transaction -> same publishTransfer path\nSources: canvasHistoryService.ts, MappingPage.tsx, canvasSession.ts,\n         workspacePersistence.ts, recordStorage.ts, workspaceStorage.ts","asciiSha256":"6ce59718ebab155b98ee2d5523b806ba5653b494017bff6fce9f91f2bb3b0d48","structure":{"kind":"diagram"}},"sourceContext":{"contentHash":"6ce59718ebab155b98ee2d5523b806ba5653b494017bff6fce9f91f2bb3b0d48","mappings":[],"evidence":{}}},"nodeRefs":{"alt-slot-7:0:6ce59718ebab155b98ee2d5523b806ba5653b494017bff6fce9f91f2bb3b0d48:node-3-1":"node-d984617d-5ee6-406b-a880-9d75642a5f94","alt-slot-7:0:6ce59718ebab155b98ee2d5523b806ba5653b494017bff6fce9f91f2bb3b0d48:node-4-3":"node-09e648fe-e6c1-4294-b6eb-a36846d7d6c9","alt-slot-7:0:6ce59718ebab155b98ee2d5523b806ba5653b494017bff6fce9f91f2bb3b0d48:node-7-1":"node-0a01df81-b29d-4d95-a0d1-61003a177572","alt-slot-7:0:6ce59718ebab155b98ee2d5523b806ba5653b